## Commits

Conventional Commits, imperative mood, scoped when useful:

```
feat(auth): add session refresh endpoint
fix(leaderboard): use metric direction in tie-break
docs(adr): record decision on scoring worker
```

## Definition of done

1. Code + tests pass locally: `<test command>`.
2. Lint/format clean: `<lint command>`.
3. **Docs decision stated** (ADR / docs update / none) — see the documentation contract in `CLAUDE.md`.
4. User-facing copy in all supported locales: <list or "n/a">.

## Decision records

Durable technical decisions go to `docs/adr/` (see its README for the rules). If your change contradicts an accepted ADR, write a superseding ADR in the same PR — do not silently drift.
